  m_text: "My friends, you have learned a great deal. The time has now come to face
    your first trial. You must enter the catacombs where Fellmarg\u2019s tomb lies.
    You must find and destroy Verag, the vile gargoyle hiding there. It will not
    be easy, and you will have to work as a team to survive. This is the first step
    on your journey toward becoming true heroes. Be careful, my friends."
